## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to craft a concrete, measurable plan for a real production issue involving memory management in a multi-tenant, NUMA-aware host.

## Key Concepts
- Memory cgroups v2 quotas (memory.max, memory.high)
- THP behavior and policy controls
- NUMA binding and memory locality
- Page cache and slab/page allocator pressure
- Observability with BPF (page_faults, migrated_pages, slabinfo)

